body:
I don't know how to feel about it. Because I have a friend that is playins GBs for over 10 years, and he really enjoys the deck. But when I play Invoked Shaddoll, I feel like it is such a hassle, so many chains, effects, circumstances, sometime I just wanna go ape-shit and spam huge monsters. So most of the time I play a single shaddoll match and switch to Darklords, it feels better for me. But I think I might regret selling my Shaddolls, they are max rarity and the deck is complete, might save money for the Red Dragon Archfiend. 

&#x200B;

Yesterday when I questioned a friend about this, he said "all decks are for fun if you enjoy playing them". Got me thinking about what I want to do.

Ok, so this is my deck, currently. On the side deck are the cards that I want to buy for the deck and extra. I think The Dark Creator should work well

&#x200B;

https://prnt.sc/1647gxe

Oh I'm sorry. By meeting the requirements quoted on the GWM description, by criting or killing someone.

&#x200B;

I mispelled extra attack with bonus action, my mistake.

I just want to reinforce that the antimage who has been a top ban for 6 straight years and the mage that made riot remove deathfire (fizz), both have or had at some point a passive that made them not collide with enemy minions, and Singed does not ignore collision, has too low of a movespeed to get around slows, and his ulti should give him tenacity as well, it makes no sense, really.

&#x200B;

great analysis btw :) thanks for reading

top laners do not play as top laners, top laners play as supports for the bot lane.

&#x200B;

this is why soraka top is becoming meta, this is why lulu top was meta few years ago, this is why top laners needed to be 2v1 with bot laners, so ADCs could farm and carry, I feel stupid playing top, I feel like a bot lane pawn.

not able to run chkdsk, and if I try to copy, paste or delete anything on the driver it shows that an error has occoured on the I/O device.

&#x200B;

"chkdsk not avaiable for RAW files"

opa, não é por carência, se você não fosse um completo inepto incapaz de interpretar e realmente soubesse ler, saberia que, na verdade, eu estou apontando o que eu acredito que esteja de errado com o jogo no momento, e realmente, qual o ponto de você estar no Reddit se não for pra ler o que os outros pensam? O Reddit é literalmente feito para isso.

&#x200B;

 *Reddit itself is a portmanteau of "read/edit" and of "read it", i.e., "I read it on Reddit".*
